// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P2099876426" "You find the plank of a ship with a message carved into it which reads:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P2739969972" "<i>Hey Lusca,<br>Ugh! I am so lonely this year. I hate Valentine's Day! I don't want to see another hero again, like, ever. The last one to come by was abusive and we only met up like twice. Hasn't visited since. Figures, I don't know why I'm surprised, that's all that ever happens. Why can't I find a nice plesiosaurus guy to hang out with?<br><br>Anyway, I'm officially striking against Valentine's Day, so if you are with me, come over. We'll capsize some fishing boats and eat until we can't move.<br>-Sally</i><br><br><color yellow>Either this is a prank, or the Salamanca monster is actually sending a message to Lusca, the giant octopus that has been sighted from time to time around the coast of Paragon City.<br><br>This has got to be a prank. Best to take it to DJ Zero for confirmation, sounds like Lusca and Sally are on the warpath this Valentine's Day.</color>"
// Script Variable SENDER_NAME :
"P4037421771" "Sally"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P4091223668" "This wooden plank has had a message carved into it intended for Lusca."
// Script Variable UNDELIVERABLE_EXPLANATION :
"P2137173020" "Given the nature of this letter, you're pretty sure Lusca would have no interest in hearing you out as a mail carrier."
// Script Variable UNDELIVERABLE_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P3933490309" "Lusca is a difficult girl to track down, let alone convince not to try and eat you in favor of reading a Valentine message from her girlfriend, Sally. However, she absolutely rocks on the turn tables, in case you've never heard her.<br><br>Hey, why don't you take a spin on the dance floor and try to catch a few Valentines for yourself? You're really getting into the swing of things."
// AskAboutTextOverride :
"P3668577043" "Reconsider your options"
// ContactRequiresText :
"P3611273721" "You are of the wrong alignment to get this tip."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2659787689" "You're unsure of exactly what to do with this information"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1255120992" "This Valentine is of no use to you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1338064068" "You already have enough things to do."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3623388284" "You're currently too busy to act upon this information."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3299591369" "Failsafe"

