// Page ValentineIntro Text :
"P2012202136" "<font face=title><scale 1.1><span align=center><color pink>To {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME} from {SENDER_NAME}...</color></span></scale></font><br><span align=center><color pink><i>Valentine</i></color></span><br><br>{VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT}<br><br><scale 1.1><font face=computer><color BurlyWood>{VALENTINE_TEXT}</scale></font></color><br><br>This Valentine was intended for {CORRECT_DELIVERY_NAME}, but delivering it is impossible..."
// Answer Text :
