"P2392409874" "Synapse"
// Script Variable CORRECT_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P3579679363" "Hey, alright, what's the occasion?<br><br><color orange>As you begin to mention the card you realize that it is gone and find that it is burning on the ground not far from you. Synapse gives you a look as if he had nothing to do with that.</color><br><br>Nice of you to bring me this Valentine's gift, {HeroName}. Very thoughtful."
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_NAME :
"P368479866" "Swan"
// Script Variable WRONG_DELIVERY_TEXT :
"P3830161136" "<color orange>Swan reads the card and glances to the beverages, then back to the card.</color><br><br>This is so sad. Why hasn't that dummy found a date yet? I mean, sheesh, I'd date him...<br><br><color orange>Swan gives you a look like, 'did I just say that out loud?'</color><br><br>Right, so... I guess I'll go take these to Synapse then? Thanks, {HeroName}. Wish me luck."
// Script Variable VALENTINE_DISCOVERY_TEXT :
"P3604882615" "You find a six pack of Paragon Pale Ale with an attached note. It reads:"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_TEXT :
"P3070715984" "<i>Hey buddy,<br>Just a reminder from yourself that somebody cares about you: yourself. Here's something to look forward to on Valentine's Day just in case you end up striking out.<br>-Synapse</i><br><br><color yellow>Hmmm, apparently Synapse has covered all his bases, readying for an apparently uneventful Valentine's Day. You could deliver his present to him, but on the other hand, you've never seen Swan with anyone. At the very least, maybe she would like to kick back with Synapse. And who knows, maybe something will spark.</color>"
// Script Variable VALENTINE_CLUE :
"P3934665967" "This six pack of Paragon Pale Ale has a note attached to it from Synapse to... Himself. Just in case he strikes out this Valentine's Day."
